Z||000002||fropuff||11-17-2000||12:41 PM||||I found a few pictures.  Some are pretty detailed.  <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/002989.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/002989.html</A>   Don't like the "coupe" nose.  I think it's very ugly.  Especially with the big-a$$ headlights and the ugly rear end.  Another one is <A HREF="http://www.fiero.org/auto-mag/auto-mag.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.org/auto-mag/auto-mag.html</A>   There is a lot of pictures on this one.  Finally, <A HREF="http://www.euronet.nl/users/fo_elmo/fiero_1989.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://www.euronet.nl/users/fo_elmo/fiero_1989.htm</A>   This is the one I like.  I like everything about it.  The "unvisible" door handles, the front fascia, the Firebird-esque rear fascia; all of it.  Good luck.  I hope you can some up with something.  Hope these helped out a little.  <P>------------------<BR>Fuzz busters are for those who are worried about being caught.<p>[This message has been edited by fropuff (edited 11-17-2000).]||||reg||1
