Z||000007||Old Lar||11-17-2000||02:47 PM||||The white wheels on the 89 are the lace wheels for the GT..painted white.  Alex Maxim got a set of white lace wheels as standard equipment on a late production run of his 88.  They were using all the parts laying around and they had started making the white wheels for the next years cars, which never got built.||||reg||1
